  m_Name: Level1(1-G)
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogue:
  - "Is there something from your culture that\u2019s especially meaningful to you?
    Something you\u2019d like to experience or revisit?"
  - "Oh\u2026\r\nI wish to return to see my favorite wisteria trees. They were the
    inspiration behind my most successful piece, after all."
  - "I remember a particular grove from my youth\u2014its blooms were so lush and
    vibrant they seemed to glow in the moonlight. \r\n"
  - "No matter how hard I've tried, I\u2019ve never been able to replicate that exact
    shade of purple in glass.\r"
  - "I\u2019d give anything to stand beneath those trees again, to feel their petals
    brush against my skin. It\u2019s where my heart truly belongs."
  responses: []
